0..77 Comment "// A theory states a law that collapses its own sort: every two loops are one"
78..86 Comment "// path."
87..89 Comment "//"
90..164 Comment "// The law has the shape of axiom K, and it is sound where K on the native"
165..243 Comment "// identity is not. A law is a hypothesis, not a rule. A model owes a proof of"
244..317 Comment "// it at its carrier, and only a carrier whose loops are one can pay. The"
318..396 Comment "// native `Path` admits no such law. `here` is not a pattern, and a law over a"
397..472 Comment "// path of paths has no form today. So K reaches a theory\'s sort only as an"
473..548 Comment "// obligation on its models, never as a fact about `Path` or `Flow`. A cell"
549..612 Comment "// of the theory is a path in its models, not a path in `Type`."
613..615 Comment "//"
616..694 Comment "// `Collapsed` declares the sort and the law. `CollapsedDot` proves the law at"
695..763 Comment "// `Dot` by cases, and `one_loop` reads the proof at the law\'s path."
764..766 Comment "//"
767..854 Comment "// - see: `../../pathological/modules/law-collapsed.gandr` — the three refused routes"
855..941 Comment "// - see: `../../pathological/identity/k-derivation.gandr` — `here` is not a pattern"
